            {
              "text": "The Gold Coast luxury property market has evolved into one of Australia's most visual, content-driven real estate scenes. Several boutique and prestige agencies have distinguished themselves through high-impact video campaigns, viral social media reels, and a dedicated focus on architecturally striking homes:\n\n---\n\n### 1. WHITEFOX Real Estate (Gold Coast)\n* **The Style:** Fast-paced, editorial, provocative, and fashion-forward.\n* **Why They Stand Out:** Originating in Melbourne and expanding to the Gold Coast (headquartered at Broadbeach’s Oxley 1823 precinct), WHITEFOX is essentially built as a media company that sells real estate. They eschew traditional corporate templates in favor of punchy, agent-led video tours, cinematic cuts set to upbeat soundtracks, and bold typography.\n* **Architectural Focus:** Known for listing statement builds—including Mediterranean-inspired coastal mansions (e.g., *Villa Casa*, *Villa Alcyone*), sculptural concrete pavilions, and bespoke coastal developments by firms like GRAYA and Jayson Pate Design.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Kollosche\n* **The Style:** Cinematic lifestyle films, high-gloss production, and understated elegance.\n* **Why They Stand Out:** While Kollosche has grown into a major market force, it retains a bespoke, high-touch boutique ethos. They were among the earliest on the Coast to treat listing videos like mini-films, partnering with top videography houses to produce cinematic lifestyle stories (often blending golden-hour drone work, curated interior vignettes, and lifestyle narratives). Their Instagram and YouTube channels are go-to destinations for Australian prestige design tours.\n* **Architectural Focus:** They dominate the blue-chip market across Mermaid Beach (*Hedges Avenue*), Main Beach, Burleigh Heads, and hinterland retreats. They regularly represent homes designed by leading firms such as BDA Architecture, Koichi Takada, Paul Uhlmann, and MAS Architecture Studio.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Amir Prestige Group\n* **The Style:** High-octane luxury, aspirational lifestyle, and viral reach.\n* **Why They Stand Out:** Led by Amir Mian, this agency leans heavily into ultra-luxury showmanship. Their video campaigns often integrate luxury supercars, yachts, and helicopter cinematography to showcase waterfront estates. Amir Prestige produces reels and short-form walkthroughs that frequently generate hundreds of thousands—and sometimes millions—of impressions across Instagram and TikTok, drawing interstate and overseas buyers.\n* **Architectural Focus:** Ultra-prime waterfronts (Monaco Street, Sovereign Islands, Broadbeach Waters) and modern architectural retreats in the Currumbin Valley and Tallebudgera. They regularly list striking Brutalist concrete estates, mid-century Mediterranean hybrids, and expansive riverfront sanctuaries.\n\n---\n\n### 4. GV Property Group\n* **The Style:** Design-led, architectural, and development-focused.\n* **Why They Stand Out:** Based in Burleigh Heads, GV Property Group operates as a specialized boutique firm closely connected to high-end developers, top architects, and bespoke builders. Rather than standard residential hype, their marketing feels closer to an architectural digest, utilizing clean renders, sophisticated site walk-throughs, and social collateral tailored to architecture purists.\n* **Architectural Focus:** Boutique multi-residential sites, full-floor sky homes, and luxury beachfront builds along Palm Beach and Burleigh Heads. They frequently work around designs by Plus Architecture, Contreras Earl, and BDA.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Harcourts Coastal Prestige (Boutique Division)\n* **The Style:** Agent-centric, direct-to-camera storytelling and beachfront lifestyle tours.\n* **Why They Stand Out:** While under the broader Coastal network umbrella, the dedicated Prestige division operates as a specialized boutique unit. Agents like Tolemy Stevens (renowned for absolute beachfronts) have cultivated enormous social followings through high-production beachfront walk-and-talks, sunset drone footage, and real-time market updates that feel polished yet authentic.\n* **Architectural Focus:** Trophy beachfront residences along the strip—Mermaid Beach, Surfers Paradise, and Main Beach—spanning mid-century modern restorations to cutting-edge contemporary towers.\n\n---\n\n### What to Look For When Choosing:\n* **Editorial & Content Vibe:** If you want **edgy, viral, and fast-paced**, **WHITEFOX** leads the modern social curve.\n* **Scale & Polished Prestige:** If you want **cinematic, magazine-tier film production** with unmatched local prestige reach, **Kollosche** and **Amir Prestige** set the benchmark.\n* **Architectural & Design Credentials:** If the home is an off-the-plan developer collaboration or architecturally pure project, **GV Property Group** brings deep architectural alignment.",
